"P2951670783" "The Personal Force Field is almost impenetrable to all attacks, even Psionics and Enemy Teleportation, although attacks from more powerful foes may get through more easily. Personal Force Field will also reduce the damage of any attacks that do get through."
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1154587709" "Your {PowerName} makes you virtually invulnerable to most attacks."

