"P2138267515" "Ball Lightning"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3097711731" "Targeted AoE Energy, -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P3101121515" "Hurls a highly charged ball of lightning that explodes on contact.  Ball Lightning deals good damage in an area and also drains some Endurance from each target it hits."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1304278633" "{PowerName} continues to electrocute you for {Damage} points of energy damage."

