// Display Name :
"P2526307079" "Neutrino Bolt"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P456880761" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Energy), Foe -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P1248940493" "A very quick, but low damage attack. Neutrino Blast can reduce the target's Defense. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Very Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P373215750" "-DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P4200807967" "Your Defense has been reduced by the Neutrino Bolt."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2384074025" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage and reduces your Defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Irradiate 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3608202196" "Irradiate"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2932091202" "Close (AoE), Moderate DoT(Energy), Foe -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P1144931196" "You can emit lethal amounts of radiation in all directions, damaging all nearby foes for a short time. Like other Radiation attacks, this power can bypass some of a target's defenses. Irradiate severely reduces the target's Defense. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1338093887" "DoT(Energy), -DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P635508336" "You are irradiated and taking damage over time.  Your Defense has been reduced."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2610273664" "{PlayerSource} Irradiates you for {Damage} points of energy damage, and reduces your defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Electron Haze 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2879089858" "Electron Haze"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2021752215" "Close, Moderate DMG(Energy), Foe -DEF, Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P1914614535" "A short range conical blast of free electrons. This attack can bypass some of a target's defenses and reduce the target's Defense. It can also knock some targets down. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1562198531" "The Electron Haze has reduced your Defenses."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3617101885" "{PlayerSource} blasts you with an {PowerName} for {Damage} points of energy damage and reduces your Defense!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Cosmic Burst 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1205668238" "Cosmic Burst"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1189482063" "Close, Extreme DMG(Energy), Foe Disorient, -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P3117669899" "Cosmic Burst smashes the target with cosmic particles. The attack is very short range, but the damage is devastating and can leave most targets Disoriented and with reduced Defense. Damage: Superior, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P788279074" "Disorient, -DEF"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2184880234" "You are disoriented and your Defenses are reduced."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Neutron Bomb 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1608951300" "Neutron Bomb"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3451728190" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DMG(Energy), Foe -DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P2939795129" "This devastating attack lobs an explosive sphere of deadly radiation, damaging the target and all nearby foes. Neutron Bomb can bypass some of a target's defenses and reduce the target's Defense. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3706169582" "The Neutron Bomb has reduced your Defenses."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3863779789" "A {PowerName} explodes on you for {Damage} points of energy damage, and your Defense is reduced!"

