"P1966462850" "{PlayerSource} devastates you with an {PowerName} for a whopping {Damage} points of energy damage and has reduced your Defense!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P627020323" "{PlayerSource} devastates you with an {PowerName} for a whopping {Damage} points of energy damage!"

