"P1566888920" "You are able to tear up a chunk of ground beneath your feet and Hurl it at an enemy. This attack is close ranged, deals moderate damage, and can knock foes back. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Foot Stomp 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P2060142457" "Using your superior leg strength, you can Stomp your foot to the ground, quaking the earth itself. This is a localized attack against everything in melee range. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Hammer of Justice 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P518026661" "Hammer of Justice"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P777593458" "Knockback"
// Power Help Text :
"P3484630947" "Statesman calls upon the power of the gods to strike down upon you."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3062160003" "{PlayerSource} annihilates you with a {PowerName} you for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dull Pain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P576038185" "Self Heal, +Max HP"
// Power Help Text :
"P2108311222" "You can activate this power to increase your maximum Hit Points for a short time. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2226385479" "You {PowerName} and increase your maximum Hit Points."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Unstoppable 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P1545815299" "When you activate this power, you not only become extremely resistant to most damage, but also to Disorient, Immobilization, Hold, and Sleep effects. Endurance recovery is also increased. Unstoppable costs little Endurance to activate, but when it wears off you are left exhausted, and drained of almost all Health and Endurance. Recharge: Very Long"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
